    "id": "spring-wedge",
    "prefix": "m4b_spring_wedge",
    "title": "A spring couples the block and wedge",
    "description": "A 10 N/m spring joins the block to the moving wedge. Released unstretched, it pulls the block back up the incline as the wedge reverses with it. The spring is ideal and undamped; both bodies remain constrained to their guides.",
